primitive |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-14-| orca | Workflow-as-code orchestration | MEDIUM | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Typed resumable stages where each stage = one git commit + progress-log checkpoint |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-15-| agent-workspace-fabric | Worktree lifecycle control plane | MEDIUM | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Frozen transition allow-list + pure `decide()` monitor core + fencing-epoch claims |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-16-| cezar | Multi-runner CLI orchestration | LOW | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Evidence-graded usage-limit parsing with durable auto-resume and a two-hold account model |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-17-| ralphex | Review convergence loops | MEDIUM | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Dual-evidence completion gate + git-fingerprint stalemate counter |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-18-| smithers | Durable time-travel runtime | MEDIUM | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Write-ahead tool journal + leased/fenced destructive rewind in one transaction |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-19-| beads | Persistent task graph / work queue | LOW | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Materialized `is_blocked` + row-version CAS claims + ephemeral lease plane |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-20-| agent-governance-toolkit | Policy decision engine | LOW | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Stateless fail-closed PDP: snapshot → one verdict, every error path denies |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-21-| grit | Semantic (AST-symbol) ownership | LOW | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Atomic symbol leases with dependency-aware transitive read-locking |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-22-| opentraces | Trace/evidence capture | LOW | REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN | Content-addressed hash-chained event log in git refs + closed evidence-tier vocabularies |\ndocs/research/REFERENCE_REPOSITORY_FINDINGS.md-23-| nono | OS-level sandbox | MEDIUM | DEPENDENCY_CANDIDATE | Landlock + secco